my promo code\u00a0it was the same price to buy 50 as it was 500, so I have lots left. I'm happy to share if anyone would like some!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They are standard business card size with a\u00a0glossy front pic and\u00a0blank on the back. There are no names or dates anywhere on them, just the beach pic and the saying, so easy to use for your own beach wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will send you as many as you need for 5.00 USD, including padded envelope and shipping.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning! : )<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taryn13@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"142.30.53.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437555403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TaraW","Id":284073,"Name":"TaraW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.108.30.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79936,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f80a59b7fc0c03a2207838be0b5e15c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s an idea of what they look like when you put them in the clear holders. (Sorry, I can&#039;t seem to rotate and save the pic properly!)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35080,"Name":"cards 3.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-284073-0-28893100-1455227099.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-284073-0-28893100-1455227099_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":747}],"Id":1910777,"PostDate":1455209104,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  b